1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,600
Your people and agents see different truths.

2
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:09,420
The truth is scattered across the systems where work happens.

3
00:00:09,770 --> 00:00:11,310
People rebuild it by hand.

4
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:12,980
Agents start without it.

5
00:00:14,030 --> 00:00:17,020
Navis turns those signals into one shared understanding.

6
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,282
Every email, meeting,

7
00:00:21,322 --> 00:00:23,640
document and message becomes a signal —

8
00:00:24,400 --> 00:00:25,820
remembered, connected,

9
00:00:26,190 --> 00:00:28,100
and turned into what should happen next.

10
00:00:28,950 --> 00:00:31,590
Inside a company, the Navis App is for people.

11
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:33,850
It shows what changed —

12
00:00:34,290 --> 00:00:35,630
and why it matters.

13
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,980
Every fact has its source,

14
00:00:38,250 --> 00:00:40,090
its time, and how fresh it is.

15
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:42,330
When something needs a decision,

16
00:00:42,660 --> 00:00:44,340
Navis prepares the next step.

17
00:00:46,070 --> 00:00:47,420
A person decides.

18
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:51,050
Then the company acts.

19
00:00:53,250 --> 00:00:56,040
The same company's agents use Navis Developer.

20
00:00:56,520 --> 00:00:57,270
Invite the team.

21
00:00:58,140 --> 00:01:03,340
Connect once — through MCP, API, SDK or CLI.

22
00:01:04,200 --> 00:01:05,130
The agent asks —

23
00:01:05,550 --> 00:01:07,720
and gets the company's context,

24
00:01:07,950 --> 00:01:09,560
with sources and freshness.

25
00:01:10,310 --> 00:01:12,080
Navis isn't the model.

26
00:01:13,660 --> 00:01:15,810
It supplies the company's truth.

27
00:01:16,770 --> 00:01:19,380
Every request is checked against its permissions.

28
00:01:19,970 --> 00:01:21,020
The agent does the work,

29
00:01:21,340 --> 00:01:22,750
and the run is on record.

30
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:25,740
A solo builder gets a private workspace.

31
00:01:25,960 --> 00:01:27,200
A team can work together.

32
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:29,860
And the work state carries into the next session.

33
00:01:32,990 --> 00:01:33,650
One company.

34
00:01:34,210 --> 00:01:36,920
The person and the agent acted on the same event.

35
00:01:37,570 --> 00:01:38,300
Same facts.

36
00:01:38,950 --> 00:01:39,730
Same sources.

37
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:41,200
Same freshness.

38
00:01:41,800 --> 00:01:42,850
One understanding.

39
00:01:43,470 --> 00:01:44,070
Two ways in.

40
00:01:45,210 --> 00:01:46,030
Models change.

41
00:01:46,080 --> 00:01:46,980
Agents change.

42
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:47,880
Tools change.

43
00:01:50,440 --> 00:01:53,030
What your company knows shouldn't have to start over.

44
00:01:53,900 --> 00:01:54,650
Company-owned.

45
00:01:54,900 --> 00:01:55,800
Model-neutral.

46
00:01:56,050 --> 00:01:57,950
Shared by people and agents.

47
00:01:58,800 --> 00:01:59,470
NavisLabs.

48
00:02:01,430 --> 00:02:03,810
The shared understanding for your organization.

